WEBVTT

00:14:26.015 --> 00:14:30.197
that I could not pick a voice out
from the background noise,

00:14:30.221 --> 00:14:32.189
and I just wanted to escape.

00:14:32.818 --> 00:14:37.962
Because I could not identify the position
of my body in space,

00:14:37.986 --> 00:14:41.803
I felt enormous and expansive,

00:14:41.827 --> 00:14:45.398
like a genie just liberated
from her bottle.

00:14:46.652 --> 00:14:49.326
And my spirit soared free,

00:14:49.350 --> 00:14:55.000
like a great whale gliding
through the sea of silent euphoria.

00:14:56.555 --> 00:14:58.239
Nirvana.

00:14:58.263 --> 00:15:00.683
I found Nirvana.